      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Contract requiring retention/cash security; margin requirement (W3644/W3652)
Frequency: Per contract + ongoing
Volume: Cash retention and margin held
Owner: Finance / Surety Program Manager
Participants: Finance (links to VS-17), Surety Program Manager, Treasury (links to VS-18), Legal (links to VS-100.3), Sales (links to VS-46/VS-11), PMO (links to VS-112)
Source: workflow W3653 — Cash Retention, Margin &amp; Escrow Management</bpmn:documentation>
