      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3653_Start3" name="Contract requiring retention/cash security; margin requirement (W3644/W3652)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3653_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3653_Task4" name="Finance/Surety Program Manager manage cash retention and margin: where the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Finance/Surety Program Manager manage cash retention and margin: where the customer/contract holds cash retention (e.g., 5–10% per progress billing) or cash margin for a guarantee, track the retained amount, the escrow/account, and the accounting treatment (restricted cash, receivable links to VS-16/VS-17)
Responsible (R): Finance / Surety Program Manager
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per contract + ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3653_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3653_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3653_Task5" name="Finance/Surety Program Manager evaluate and execute cash-retention…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Finance/Surety Program Manager evaluate and execute cash-retention substitution: replace cash retention with a retention bond (W3651) where economic (frees cash, costs premium W3645), per contract terms and customer acceptance; manage the substitution accounting
Responsible (R): Finance / Surety Program Manager / Sales
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per contract</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3653_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3653_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3653_Task6" name="Finance manage retention/margin release on contract…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance manage retention/margin release on contract milestone/completion/warranty expiry (links to W3657), reconcile and recover the cash, and report cash-retention exposure and release cycle-time to governance (W3661) and treasury/cash (links to VS-18.1)
Responsible (R): Finance / Surety Program Manager
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3653_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3653_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3653_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3653_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
