      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3654_Start3" name="Bond issuance (W3649–W3652); monthly cycle; reporting">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3654_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3654_Task4" name="Surety Program Manager maintain the bond/guarantee encumbrance register: each…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Surety Program Manager maintain the bond/guarantee encumbrance register: each instrument&#x27;s type, beneficiary, contract, value, term, validity/expiry, provider (surety/bank), counter-indemnity/collateral, credit-line encumbrance (links to VS-18.2), status (active/released/claimed), and the linked contract/project
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3654_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3654_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3654_Task5" name="Surety Program Manager/Treasury track facility and credit-line utilization…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Surety Program Manager/Treasury track facility and credit-line utilization against limits (W3642/W3646), aggregate the contingent-liability exposure, and reconcile to the accounting records (restricted cash, contingent liability disclosure links to VS-17) and provider records
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / Treasury / Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3654_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3654_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3654_Task6" name="Surety Program Manager/BI produce the encumbrance dashboards: outstanding…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Surety Program Manager/BI produce the encumbrance dashboards: outstanding exposure by type/entity/provider/contract, facility utilization, expiring-soon bonds (links to W3656), and release-eligible bonds (links to W3657); report to governance (W3661) and treasury/risk (links to VS-18/VS-21.2)
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / BI
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3654_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3654_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3654_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3654_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
