        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-107 (ensure bond encumbrance &amp; renewal control.) | - operational: disciplined register and reconciliation; operational: expiry tracking (W3656)
Owner: Surety Program Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
