    <bpmn:process id="W_W3655" name="W3655. Multi-Entity Bond Coordination" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Multi-entity bid/contract (BuildRight Depot Inc., Logistics Inc., Digital Commerce Inc.); JV
Frequency: Per multi-entity engagement
Volume: Multi-entity bonds (5 entities)
Owner: Surety Program Manager / Cross-Entity Shared Services
Participants: Surety Program Manager, Cross-Entity Shared Services (links to VS-72), Treasury (links to VS-18), Legal/Corporate Secretary (links to VS-100.3/VS-36), Entity Finance, Sales (links to VS-46/VS-11)
Source: workflow W3655 — Multi-Entity Bond Coordination</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3655_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3655_Lane1" name="Surety Program Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3655_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3655_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3655_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3655_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3655_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3655_Start3" name="Multi-entity bid/contract (BuildRight Depot Inc., Logistics Inc., Digital Commerce Inc.)…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3655_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3655_Task4" name="Surety Program Manager/Legal determine the bonding entity for each engagement…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Surety Program Manager/Legal determine the bonding entity for each engagement: which BuildRight entity is the contracting party (Depot Inc. retail, Logistics Inc. distribution, Digital Commerce Inc., or a JV), the corporate authorization for that entity, and any joint-and-several liability across entities
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / Legal / Corporate Secretary
Accountable (A): CFO / CEO
Duration: Per engagement</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3655_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3655_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3655_Task5" name="Surety Program Manager/Treasury arrange the bond in the correct entity name…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Surety Program Manager/Treasury arrange the bond in the correct entity name with the entity-level facility (W3642) and counter-indemnity (W3644), manage JV-partner bonding (where BuildRight&#x27;s share requires a proportional bond), and coordinate intercompany allocation of the premium/cost (links to VS-72)
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / Treasury / Cross-Entity
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per engagement</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3655_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3655_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3655_Task6" name="Surety Program Manager/Cross-Entity track the bond by entity in the encumbrance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Surety Program Manager/Cross-Entity track the bond by entity in the encumbrance register (W3654), allocate premium/collateral/encumbrance to the correct entity for accounting (links to VS-17/VS-72), and report multi-entity surety exposure to governance (W3661)
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / Cross-Entity / Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3655_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3655_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3655_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3655_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3655_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-578 (ensure controlled execution — Bond/Guarantee Application, Issuance, Tracking &amp; Encumbrance Management (PA-116.2).) | - operational: entity determination discipline; operational: JV agreement and proportional bonding
Owner: Surety Program Manager / Cross-Entity Shared Services</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3655_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3655_Annotation8" targetRef="W3655_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3655_Flow10" sourceRef="W3655_Start3" targetRef="W3655_Task4" />
