    <bpmn:process id="W_W3656" name="W3656. Bond Amendment, Extension &amp; Renewal Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Contract change; bond nearing expiry; milestone
Frequency: Per amendment + ongoing expiry management
Volume: Bond amendments and renewals
Owner: Surety Program Manager
Participants: Surety Program Manager, Sales (links to VS-46/VS-11), Treasury (links to VS-18), Legal (links to VS-100.3), PMO (links to VS-112), Surety/Bank, Finance (links to VS-17)
Source: workflow W3656 — Bond Amendment, Extension &amp; Renewal Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3656_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3656_Lane1" name="Surety Program Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3656_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3656_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3656_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3656_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3656_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3656_Start3" name="Contract change; bond nearing expiry; milestone">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3656_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3656_Task4" name="Surety Program Manager/Sales initiate the amendment/extension on contract…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Surety Program Manager/Sales initiate the amendment/extension on contract change or nearing expiry: scope/value/term change, extension of validity beyond original, milestone-linked reduction (e.g., reduce performance bond on substantial completion), and the beneficiary consent; verify authority (W3647)
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / Sales / Legal
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3656_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3656_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3656_Task5" name="Surety Program Manager/Treasury/Surety arrange the amendment/renewal…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Surety Program Manager/Treasury/Surety arrange the amendment/renewal: surety/bank processing, additional/reduced premium (W3645), counter-indemnity/collateral adjustment (W3644), and the amended/renewed instrument; manage the expiry-driven renewal pipeline (W3654) before lapse
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / Treasury / Surety/Bank
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per change (days)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3656_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3656_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3656_Task6" name="Surety Program Manager update the encumbrance register (W3654) and records…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Surety Program Manager update the encumbrance register (W3654) and records (W3648), communicate to the beneficiary and PMO (links to VS-112), and report amendment/renewal activity and lapse-risk to governance (W3661)
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3656_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3656_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3656_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3656_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3656_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-107 (ensure bond encumbrance &amp; renewal control.) | - operational: expiry pipeline and lead-time; operational: review
Owner: Surety Program Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3656_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3656_Annotation8" targetRef="W3656_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
